                  "source": "local-wiki-sqlite",
                  "pageTitle": "Hunter Munitions",
                  "pageId": 1235676,
                  "revisionId": 2722408,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "Slash is affected by status duration mods. Using Hunter Track in tandem with Hunter Munitions will increase the base 6-second duration to 11.4 seconds, allowing for 11 ticks of damage rather than the normal 6 ticks."
                }
              },
              {
                "reviewStatus": "draft",
