                  "pageTitle": "Hunter Munitions",
                  "pageId": 1235676,
                  "revisionId": 2722408,
                  "section": "Notes",
                  "excerpt": "The 30% trigger chance is independent to itself and is not affected by the weapon's Status Chance , or damage type distribution, besides being indirectly affected by its Critical Chance ."
                }
              },
              {
